    "%@ has no spot on the board (it needs both “row” and “column”)." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
