          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is full on iPad and Mac. Make its tiles smaller there first." : {
      "comment" : "A description of an error that might occur when moving a tile on an iPad or Mac.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ está lleno en iPad y Mac. Primero haz las casillas más pequeñas allí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ est plein sur iPad et Mac. Rendez d'abord ses cases plus petites là-bas."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ist auf iPad und Mac voll. Mach dort zuerst die Felder kleiner."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ está cheia no iPad e no Mac. Primeiro deixe os cartões menores lá."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ è piena su iPad e Mac. Prima rimpicciolisci lì le sue caselle."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 在 iPad 和 Mac 上已满。请先在那里把卡片调小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is full, so the copy is waiting below the board for a spot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ está lleno, así que la copia espera debajo del tablero hasta que haya un lugar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ est plein, donc la copie attend sous le tableau qu'une place se libère."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ist voll, deshalb wartet die Kopie unter der Tafel auf einen Platz."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ está cheia, então a cópia espera embaixo da prancha até ter um lugar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ è piena, quindi la copia aspetta sotto la tabella che si liberi un posto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已满，副本会在沟通板下方等待空位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is full. Make the tiles smaller (the size button at the top right) or hide a tile you don't need." : {
      "comment" : "An error message displayed when a user tries to add a new tile to a board that is full. The argument is the name of the board.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ está lleno. Haz las casillas más pequeñas (el botón de tamaño, arriba a la derecha) u oculta una casilla que no necesites."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ est plein. Rendez les cases plus petites (le bouton de taille, en haut à droite) ou masquez une case dont vous n'avez pas besoin."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ist voll. Mach die Felder kleiner (die Größentaste oben rechts) oder blende ein Feld aus, das du nicht brauchst."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ está cheia. Deixe os cartões menores (o botão de tamanho, no canto superior direito) ou oculte um cartão que você não usa."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ è piena. Rimpicciolisci le caselle (il pulsante della dimensione in alto a destra) o nascondi una casella che non ti serve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已满。请把卡片调小（右上角的大小按钮），或隐藏一张不需要的卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is missing its ID. Every board and tile needs its own ID." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ no tiene ID. Cada tablero y cada casilla necesitan su propio ID."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ n'a pas d'identifiant. Chaque tableau et chaque case ont besoin de leur propre identifiant."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ hat keine ID. Jede Tafel und jedes Feld braucht eine eigene ID."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ não tem ID. Cada prancha e cada cartão precisam do seu próprio ID."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ non ha un ID. Ogni tabella e ogni casella hanno bisogno del loro ID."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 缺少 ID。每块沟通板和每张卡片都需要自己的 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is missing “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is missing “%2$@”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ no tiene «%2$@»."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il manque « %2$@ » à %1$@."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei %1$@ fehlt „%2$@“."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falta “%2$@” em %1$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In %1$@ manca «%2$@»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 缺少“%2$@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is outside %@: it's at row %lld, column %lld, but the board has %lld rows and %lld columns (counting from 0)." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is outside %2$@: it's at row %3$lld, column %4$lld, but the board has %5$lld rows and %6$lld columns (counting from 0)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está fuera de %2$@: está en la fila %3$lld, columna %4$lld, pero el tablero tiene %5$lld filas y %6$lld columnas (contando desde 0)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ est en dehors de %2$@ : elle est ligne %3$lld, colonne %4$lld, mais le tableau a %5$lld lignes et %6$lld colonnes (en comptant à partir de 0)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ liegt außerhalb von %2$@: Es ist in Zeile %3$lld, Spalte %4$lld, aber die Tafel hat %5$lld Zeilen und %6$lld Spalten (ab 0 gezählt)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está fora de %2$@: está na linha %3$lld, coluna %4$lld, mas a prancha tem %5$lld linhas e %6$lld colunas (contando a partir de 0)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ è fuori da %2$@: si trova alla riga %3$lld, colonna %4$lld, ma la tabella ha %5$lld righe e %6$lld colonne (contando da 0)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 在 %2$@ 之外：它位于第 %3$lld 行第 %4$lld 列，但这块沟通板只有 %5$lld 行 %6$lld 列（从 0 开始数）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is too small. A board needs at least 2 spots." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ es demasiado pequeño. Un tablero necesita al menos 2 lugares."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ est trop petit. Un tableau a besoin d'au moins 2 places."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ist zu klein. Eine Tafel braucht mindestens 2 Plätze."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ é pequena demais. Uma prancha precisa de pelo menos 2 lugares."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ è troppo piccola. Una tabella ha bisogno di almeno 2 posti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 太小了。一块沟通板至少需要 2 个位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ opens a board that isn't in this file. It still speaks; it will open the board once that board is added." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ abre un tablero que no está en este archivo. Sigue hablando; abrirá el tablero cuando se añada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ouvre un tableau qui n'est pas dans ce fichier. Elle parle quand même ; elle ouvrira le tableau une fois qu'il aura été ajouté."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ öffnet eine Tafel, die nicht in dieser Datei ist. Es spricht trotzdem und öffnet die Tafel, sobald sie hinzugefügt wird."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ abre uma prancha que não está neste arquivo. Ele continua falando e vai abrir a prancha quando ela for adicionada."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ apre una tabella che non è in questo file. Parla comunque, e aprirà la tabella quando verrà aggiunta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 会打开一块不在此文件中的沟通板。它仍会说话；那块沟通板加入后就会打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ says “%@”. Hum leaves out praise, reward and instruction phrases, because tiles are your child's own voice." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ says “%2$@”. Hum leaves out praise, reward and instruction phrases, because tiles are your child's own voice."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ dice «%2$@». Hum no incluye frases de elogio, premio ni órdenes, porque las casillas son la propia voz de tu hijo o hija."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ dit « %2$@ ». Hum écarte les phrases de félicitation, de récompense et de consigne, car les cases sont la propre voix de votre enfant."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ sagt „%2$@“. Hum lässt Lob, Belohnungs- und Anweisungssätze weg, denn die Felder sind die eigene Stimme deines Kindes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ diz “%2$@”. O Hum deixa de fora frases de elogio, recompensa e ordens, porque os cartões são a própria voz da sua criança."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ dice «%2$@». Hum non include frasi di lode, premio o istruzione, perché le caselle sono la voce di tuo figlio o tua figlia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 说的是“%2$@”。Hum 不收录表扬、奖励和指令类的话，因为卡片是孩子自己的声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
