    "It only suggests. Nothing changes until you tap Add." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the AI helper's limitations.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo sugiere. Nada cambia hasta que tocas Añadir."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il ne fait que suggérer. Rien ne change tant que vous ne touchez pas Ajouter."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er macht nur Vorschläge. Nichts ändert sich, bis du auf Hinzufügen tippst."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ele só sugere. Nada muda até você tocar em Adicionar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suggerisce soltanto. Niente cambia finché non tocchi Aggiungi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它只提供建议。在你轻点“添加”之前，什么都不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its spot will be empty. Other tiles stay where they are. You can undo this." : {
      "comment" : "The body of a confirmation dialog that asks whether to delete a tile.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su lugar quedará vacío. Las demás casillas se quedan donde están. Puedes deshacerlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sa place restera vide. Les autres cases restent où elles sont. Vous pouvez annuler."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sein Platz bleibt leer. Die anderen Felder bleiben, wo sie sind. Du kannst es widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
