    "The file is missing “formatVersion”. Add \"formatVersion\": 1 at the top." : {
      "comment" : "A problem found in a Hum file. The first value is the board or tile it is about (like Tile “snack”). Words in “ ” such as “spokenText” are names from the file: keep them as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al archivo le falta «formatVersion». Añade \"formatVersion\": 1 al principio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il manque « formatVersion » dans le fichier. Ajoutez \"formatVersion\": 1 au début."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In der Datei fehlt „formatVersion“. Füge oben \"formatVersion\": 1 hinzu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O arquivo não tem “formatVersion”. Adicione \"formatVersion\": 1 no início."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nel file manca «formatVersion». Aggiungi \"formatVersion\": 1 all'inizio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件缺少“formatVersion”。请在开头添加 \"formatVersion\": 1。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file's Home becomes a folder called “%@” on your Home." : {
